---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About - KharchaTracker" showNav={false}>
  <a href="/" class="text-sm mb-4 inline-block no-underline" style="color: #6366f1;">&larr; Back to Home</a>

  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text);">About KharchaTracker</h1>

  <div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-4">
      <span class="text-5xl block mb-2">💰</span>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text);">Kharcha<span style="color: #6366f1;">Tracker</span></h2>
      <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Smart Expense Manager for Everyone</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text);">
      <p>KharchaTracker is a free, privacy-first expense management tool designed to help you take control of your finances. Built for the Indian audience, it works entirely in your browser with no accounts needed.</p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">What Makes Us Different</h3>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">🔒</span><div><strong>100% Private</strong> - Your data never leaves your device. No servers, no tracking.</div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">🧠</span><div><strong>Smart Insights</strong> - AI-powered spending analysis and personalized tips.</div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">🔍</span><div><strong>Deal Finder</strong> - Search the web for better alternatives to your expenses.</div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">⚡</span><div><strong>Gamified Savings</strong> - Fun challenges and goals to make saving exciting.</div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">📱</span><div><strong>Works Offline</strong> - Install as an app on your phone. No internet needed.</div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">🆓</span><div><strong>Completely Free</strong> - No premium plans, no hidden fees.</div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">📊</span><div><strong>Detailed Reports</strong> - Monthly analytics, charts, and category breakdowns.</div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-lg">🔄</span><div><strong>Recurring Tracker</strong> - Never lose track of subscriptions and EMIs.</div></div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Our Mission</h3>
      <p>We believe everyone deserves access to smart financial tools. Managing money shouldn't require expensive apps or complex software.</p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Contact</h3>
      <p>Have feedback? Email: <a href="mailto:hello@kharchatracker.com" style="color: #6366f1;">hello@kharchatracker.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="text-center text-xs mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
    <p>Version 1.0.0</p>
    <p class="mt-1">Made with love in India</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
